description = "Adapts to every distinct base element of the teammate directly behind it, including composite ancestry. Earth: +10 attack. Water: on fainting, give the next living teammate Rings (take 2 less damage per hit). Fire: on fainting, summon two ability-free 5/5 Fragments; extras are tossed away if the team has no free slots. Air: no effect yet."
